Subject: [PATCH] [Video][Database] Add tests for the library clean.

Nothing tested the clean. Cover the recent fixes to it that can be
reached without the GUI, running a silent clean over real files in a
temporary video source, and the changes to GetSubPaths() and
RemoveContentForPath() it depends on.

